# ==========================================================================
# Whitelist: the repo keeps only what the app needs to run.
# Everything else in this folder (datasets, export/, packaging and portable
# builds, tests, firmware experiments, snapshots) stays local; builds are
# published as GitHub releases.
# ==========================================================================
/*

# --- the app ---
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
!/README.md
!/ADOT_Tool.py
# imported by the app: dataset preparation
!/adot_dataset.py
# submodule: the firmware the export patches
!/CNN_Inference_Edge-AI_with_CLA

__pycache__/
*.pyc
